WEBVTT

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:09.940
How dare you ignore the orders of the
almighty ruler of Hell, Demon King Ejil?!

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.750
I sentence you to three days of
imprisonment. Guards, take him away.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.840
Demon King, have mercy!

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.290
Now, then...

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:28.140
The almighty ruler of Hell, Demon King Ejil,

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.300
will have to acquire these potions in person.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:35.050
Activate! Transportation
Magic: Quantum Bringum!

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:38.940
Though it consumes 90% of
my mana, I have no choice.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:29.360
Wel...come?

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:33.340
I-Is this Kirio Drugstore?

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.550
Yes... Are you all right?

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:44.730
Yes, I'm fine. I traveled here from a
distant land in search of new potions.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.240
May I have one?

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.700
I see. Thank you for making the trip.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:55.190
That'll be 1,200 rin per potion.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.730
You want me to pay for them? <i>Me</i>?!

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:01.660
I don't know who you are, but yes,
normally you pay for things.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.910
He doesn't seem human.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.080
Is he some non-human species?

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.430
Garo Ejil.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:14.550
Fiendish tyrant who reigns over demonkind.

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.750
Known as the Demon King.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:17.650
Demon—

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:21.500
You want me to pay for them? <i>Me</i>?

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.930
Why did he say it again? What is he, an NPC?

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:31.120
The Demon King is glaring at me.
It's actually kind of scary.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.850
But I can't give in to him here.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.020
If you want them,
you'll have to pay for them.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:43.910
Very well. I shall allow you
to offer them to me yourself.

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:47.700
"Drink as many as you'd like for free."

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.710
Go on, say it.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.330
Maybe I should avoid making
eye contact with him.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:57.130
Pay up. No matter what you
say, I expect to be paid.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.260
All customers are equal.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.220
He flinched.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:06.180
Do you not have any money?

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:09.770
Of course I don't have any human money!

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.080
Hey, you! Why did you put the potion away?

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.190
Wasn't that for me?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.290
Don't you think expecting to receive
a potion for free is a bit much?

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.990
Sorry, but you'll have to leave.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:26.450
Then I shall blow this shop down!

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:36.380
If you do that, I'll never brew
potions again. Keep that in mind.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:41.340
I'm sorry, I lied. I just want one.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.620
I am Ejil. I'm known as the Demon King.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.410
His attitude changed quick!

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.550
I'm actually pretty strong, you know.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.070
So?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.970
Uh, um, so...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:55.070
I'm trying to make a living
selling the things I make.

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:58.400
What do you think of someone who
uses their strength and status

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.900
to threaten a guy like me for free stuff?

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.200
I think that's not very nice.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:05.860
Right?

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.830
He's surprisingly meek.
Maybe I was a bit too harsh.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:13.520
Anyway, I'm surprised even
the Demon King has morals.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:17.390
Master, food is ready.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:19.550
Woof?

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.470
Woof? Welcome.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.510
W-Welcome...

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.870
Um, could you perhaps tell me your name?

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.940
My name is Garo Ejil.

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.860
I'm Noela.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:44.890
Ah, Noela! Noela... What a wonderful name!

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:47.690
Those dignified ears,
that shining silver hair,

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:50.580
those eyes that seduce countless males...

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.540
And that fluffy tail!

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:01.050
Noela, you shall be my wife.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:01.540
No.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.710
I like Master. I don't like you.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:10.390
That was awfully direct...

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:14.100
You dare to stand in my way again, human?!

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.720
My name is Reiji.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.620
And I'm not in your way.
She just doesn't like you.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.150
Woof.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.590
Master, food is ready soon.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.640
Do you think you could leave now?

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.750
W-Wait, Reiji. How about this?

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.140
If you'll give me Ms. Noela and a potion now,

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:44.050
I'll give you half the
world once I conquer it.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.710
What do you say?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:52.150
If that were to ever happen,
you'd give me half?

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.350
You must be stupid.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.280
I'm sure your underlings would be doing
all the hard work to get you there.

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:00.020
Don't you ever think about rewarding them?

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.900
Should you be giving me half when
I've done nothing to deserve it?

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:05.880
Take better care of your underlings.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:10.150
Yes, you're right.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.390
No, wait!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.600
Ms. Noela is just that valuable!

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.410
You can't have Noela.
Besides, she doesn't like you.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.440
I want a potion, and I want Ms. Noela, too!

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:23.590
What should I do?

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.950
Noela likes potions, too.

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.300
Huh? Is that true?

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.800
Then I'll take two potions!

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.380
I thought you didn't have the money for that.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.940
Oh, that's right...

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.770
You forgot about that?

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:39.220
Damn... Damn you, human.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.890
I'm the Demon King!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.570
Did I just drive off the Demon King?

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.570
What are you doing here?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.860
How's this?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.280
You scrounged up some money, huh?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.740
Indeed.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:01.500
I terrified some humans by telling them
I was the Demon King and instructed them

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.080
to put their money in this bag.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:07.750
Even the riffraff were quick to understand.

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:09.740
It's all small change.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:14.220
Did they believe you when you
said you were the Demon King?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:17.430
Did you cast some kind of spell
that proved your identity?

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:23.190
Of course not. It would've revealed my
location, and someone would've come for me.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:26.900
They must have trusted the kingly
dignity that pours off of me.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.440
Well, good job. They must've
looked at you with pity.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.450
No. Why?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:38.370
They marveled at my dignity
and were struck with fear.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.290
Wh-Why are you looking at me like that?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:52.510
This isn't nearly enough, but I'll sell
you one potion, since I feel bad for you.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.630
D-Don't do that! There's
nothing pitiful about me!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.610
How much am I short?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:00.430
I'll bring the correct amount immediately!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.140
It's fine. I feel sorry for you.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.310
I don't need your sympathy!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.770
I can't help but feel sorry for you.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:14.740
If I accept this, that would mean
acknowledging that I'm pitiful.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.590
Master, what's the matter?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:21.500
Ms. Noela, would you accept
this potion of mine?

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.180
Don't need it. I have the
potion I got from Master.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:29.710
Poor kid! He's the Demon King,

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:33.110
but he couldn't afford a potion with the money
he collected from humans who pitied him.

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:36.760
To top it off, he tried to give the
potion he received out of pity to Noela,

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.300
but she rejected it.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:41.100
You again, Reiji?

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.010
Do you want to take another
one with you as a souvenir?

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:51.590
How dare you mock me? I'm the Demon King!

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.150
Why am I being treated like this?

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.590
You should gratefully accept my pity potion.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.490
I don't want your pity potion!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.380
What I want is a potion!

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:04.580
I finished my potion.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.200
Master, make me a new one.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:09.540
That's it! If I learn to make these potions,

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.500
then Ms. Noela's body and heart will be mine!

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.300
What are you suddenly smirking about?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.650
Reiji!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:22.760
What? Quiet down.

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.180
Master Reiji, please make me your apprentice.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.470
What? Should the Demon King be bowing to me?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:32.520
If your underlings saw you,
I'm sure they'd be begging you to stop.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.940
Demon King!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.150
Sorry, can't do it.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.800
I knew you'd say that.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:42.410
Master Reiji, if you make me your
apprentice, I'll give you half the world.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.770
I don't need that.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.120
And you shouldn't say that until
after you've conquered the world.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:49.230
Also, my skills aren't something I can teach.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:53.110
I see. "Techniques aren't
taught, they're stolen."

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.030
That's the craftsman's way.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:58.830
I didn't say that. Do you really
have that much time on your hands?

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.900
What a silly question.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.930
I could come for roughly
five hours four days a week.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.910
I guess the Demon King
has a lot of free time!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.270
I shall polish your bottles.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.240
I'm not teaching you anything.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.940
Oh, we're busy on Saturday and Sunday.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.420
I guess it would be helpful
if you came on weekends.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:23.460
That's fine! I'll find a way to make it work.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.990
I'm pretty strict, you know.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.550
No problem! Bring it on!

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:28.960
Thank you for having me!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:29.490
Woof.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.880
The tea is ready.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:34.100
Oh? Who is this boy?

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:37.420
Woman, how dare you speak
that way to the Demon King?!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.920
I sentence you to whipping!

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:44.340
Is this someone I should avoid
making eye contact with?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.930
Now we won't be able to make eye contact.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.480
What is this woman?

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:57.000
And that's how the Demon King became
an employee of Kirio Drugstore.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.130
I finished cleaning the bottles.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.290
Master, what should I do next?

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:09.790
Well, let's see... Why don't you
help Noela clean the shop?

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:11.370
Got it!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.400
Mr. Ejil seems to be doing well.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.250
Today's his third day working here.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.650
It must be the power of love.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.920
Ms. Noela, I shall assist you.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:25.100
Don't need help.

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:25.790
Huh?

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.060
Ms. Noela, I'll learn how to
make those potions soon.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.300
Please wait until then.

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.870
I don't get it.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:41.150
Mr. Ejil, I've made some tea.
You're welcome to have some.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:45.570
Woman, Ms. Noela and I are
discussing work right now!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.870
Don't interrupt us!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:48.160
Hey!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:48.870
Ow!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.580
Not "woman." Call her "Ms. Mina."

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:56.790
Jeez. He acts like the Demon King
to everyone except me and Noela.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.040
Customer service would be a problem for him.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.970
He's an Elaine type.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:11.570
Master, I heard you use your skills
to help those in trouble.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:12.140
Yeah.

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:14.560
I'm facing a problem right now.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:19.690
The Eastern 3rd Division of my army
is being forced back by humans.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:24.620
At this rate, one of our
key positions will fall.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.700
Could you use your skills
to do something about this?

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.110
That's way too huge a problem!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.890
I'm not a tactician, I'm a pharmacist.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.950
I make medicines. Do you understand?

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:37.420
Hold on, has he forgotten that I'm a human?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.360
Medicines...

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:43.960
In that case, make me a medicine that will
resurrect all eight of the past Demon Kings!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.120
I believe I'd be able to
conquer the world then.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.010
With that many Demon Kings,
you'd have a civil war on your hands!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:52.180
I'm not making that.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.270
Then make me a medicine that
will kill off all humans.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.640
That'd be a weapon.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:58.670
You won't make that, either?

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:02.960
Then I'd like to know how
Ms. Noela truly feels.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:05.410
What she think really thinks of me.

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.320
I'm pretty sure she tells
you that all the time.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.790
Master, Ms. Noela is what
they call a tsundere!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:12.990
No way!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.510
I want to know.

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:18.300
Without lies, lip service, or embellishment.

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.060
Her raw feelings.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:24.670
I understand the desire not to believe
that's how she really feels, but...

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:28.590
I'd like you to make me a medicine that
will allow me to hear her true thoughts.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.850
Hear her true thoughts?

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:34.060
But there are some things
you're better off not knowing.

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:35.350
Master!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.920
No matter what she says,

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.190
you won't be disheartened, you won't
cry, and you won't go berserk.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.860
If you can promise me that,
I'll make it for you.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:52.510
Of course. I promise with
all my body and soul!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:53.470
All right.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.700
Could you gather these materials?

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:59.510
The medicine requires
some unique ingredients.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:02.130
I shall gather them. Rather,
I shall make them do it.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.590
I'll mobilize my entire army!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.380
Wait for me!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:13.010
The Demon King's army sure has it rough.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:22.890
M-Master, I've gathered the ingredients.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.560
Good work.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:27.860
Looks like you got everything.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:31.660
I'm going to rest here for a bit.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.670
You did good.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:58.780
It's done!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.040
Give It to Me Straight.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.130
Allows one to hear the true thoughts
of the person who drinks it.

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.670
Effective for half a day.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.170
I guess it doesn't matter
who feeds it to Noela.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.130
Master, what is it?

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.280
Hey, good afternoon.

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:20.260
I made a new medicine.

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:22.500
Would you like to taste
this delicious potion?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.030
I would!

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.380
Smells good.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.710
Tasty! Delicious!

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:34.250
Hey, Noela...

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:34.850
Huh?

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.390
What do you think of me?

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:37.620
Woof?

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:39.850
Master, what's gotten into you?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.810
It works! I can hear her thoughts! Wow!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.780
She looks confused.

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.520
I guess she can't hear her own inner voice.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.430
Anyway, what do you think of me?

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.800
I like you, Master.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.160
I love you, I love you, I love you!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.450
I see! What a sweet girl!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.120
Master!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.380
Ejil, it's ready.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:07.240
Understood.

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:10.410
Ms. Noela.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:15.260
I am Garo Ejil, the man who will
someday conquer this world.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:19.210
What do you think of me?

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:20.810
Whatever.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.350
She's totally indifferent!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:25.400
She neither likes nor dislikes him!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.940
In some ways, this hurts even
more than being disliked!

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.810
See? I told you. She already
tells you all the time.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:36.400
I-I'm not done yet, Master.
I-I'm just getting started.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:42.150
H-How can I make you like me?

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.240
I don't know.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.870
Become Master.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:48.450
I see. You're trying to cheer me up.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:49.330
No.

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.520
In other words, if I learn to
make potions like my master,

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.630
then you'll learn to love me.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:55.340
No.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.490
You're telling me to do my best.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:57.260
No.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.050
Ms. Noela!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.010
Stay away!

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:10.440
Someday I'll conquer the world...

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:16.100
He can use Give It to Me Straight,
but Noela already speaks her mind,

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.240
and Ejil takes everything positively.

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:22.840
Oh? Mr. Reiji, is this a new flavor of potion?

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.620
I'm going to have a sip.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.540
Wait, that's—

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:30.220
It's a bit sweet.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.630
It's delicious.

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:33.240
Uh, yeah...

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:35.550
What is she going to say to me?

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.590
Oh?

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:43.930
Mr. Ejil, you'll catch a
cold sleeping down there.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:47.180
Isn't he on the clock?
Why is this kid sleeping?

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:49.880
Her true thoughts are terrifying!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:50.860
Woof!

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.730
Mina scary.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.410
Ms. Noela, did you just call me scary?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.480
I can hear you, you know.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.250
I called Mina scary.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:11.210
What? What about me is scary?

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:15.170
She's hiding behind Mr. Reiji again.
Mr. Reiji is babying her, too.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.670
These two are always getting
up to crap like this.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:21.930
I'm sorry! I won't baby her anymore!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:25.620
Huh? What are you talking about, Mr. Reiji?

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.590
I have no idea what's going on.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:31.700
I don't have time for this. I need
to prepare lunch and do the laundry.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.610
Dark Mina is terrifying!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.890
Mina—rather, Lady Mina,
why don't you take a break?

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:39.590
We'll handle all the household chores.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:44.830
Lady Mina? But Mr. Reiji, that's my job.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.020
Ugh, my shoulders are so stiff.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.750
Noela, rub her shoulders!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:50.330
Woof!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.540
What's gotten into you, Ms. Noela?

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.840
Hey, that hurts. A little more to the left.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:57.430
Noela!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:58.370
Woof!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:01.670
Oh, right there.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.340
She's not useless after all.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.460
That feels great.

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:11.180
Hold on. Why are you trying to run away?

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:17.230
M-Master, my shift has ended.
I thought I'd leave for the day.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:21.320
My aide can be quite fussy, and I'm
worried about the 3rd Division.

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.560
You're not done yet.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.390
We're going to overcome this crisis together.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.660
Take up your position.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:29.530
Yes, Master.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.860
The only things I know how to cook
are fried rice and pot stickers!

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.990
It's delicious.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:00.650
This actually isn't too bad.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.900
Master, you did it!

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:07.750
What's gotten into everyone?
They're acting so weird.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.770
Thank goodness!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.640
I definitely can't sell this.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:18.410
If couples were to use this,
they'd get into arguments.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.840
Hearing someone's true thoughts
all the time is exhausting.

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:24.630
Lip service rocks!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.550
Closing Time

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:32.100
Thank you for making the trip
to Kirio Drugstore again today.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.140
Come again—

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.350
Huh?

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.090
Nothing!

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:43.120
Elaine, I'm coming in.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:47.030
Okay. What is it, Father?

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:50.990
This was mixed in with my laundry.

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:03.610
H-Huh?
